## Credits: Based on TauntMaster2 by Tartarusspawn (https://www.curseforge.com/members/_forgeuser2432659/projects). Modernized and rewritten by Don Thompson (Haruspex). For Scouse.
## Interface: 120000
## Notes: Threat management for tanks. Color-coded party/raid bars with one-click taunting, class icons, role icons (Tank/Healer/DPS), spell cooldown icons, readable text, custom threat colours, skull marker sizing, hide-when-solo, raid DPS filter, per-character spells, pull alerts, and Show Self option. Updated for Midnight Pre-Patch 12.0.0.
